Z||000043||DKOV||10-08-2001||12:53 AM||||Mach10...<P>They are now...  Back when I bought my '91, a GTP was actually a limited edition badge.  Now, they stick a GTP badge on every other car that leaves the line!<P>Gone are the days...<P>When my GTP got totalled, I saved the three badges off the body.  I am thinking that if I can fabricate a nice aluminum insert to replace the "Grand Prix" portion of the badge, I'll have "GTP Fiero" badges for my 88GT that carries a GTP motor  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Only a thought though.<P>DKOV -||||reg||1
